{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Barista Dream \u2014 a cozy first-person barista simulator where you brew handcrafted coffee for unique customers in a warm and relaxing caf\u00e9.  <br><br>Step behind the counter and start your journey as a passionate barista! <br><br>Take orders, prepare drinks with precision, and explore the stories of your regulars. In this first-person simulator, it\u2019s all about atmosphere, attention to detail, and the joy of making the perfect cup of coffee. <br><br> Realistic Coffee Making <br><br> Grind beans, press espresso, steam milk, carefully pour, and create delicious drinks step by step. Each drink uses different ingredients and different preparation methods.<br> <br>Cozy and Relaxing Atmosphere <br><br> Enjoy peaceful music, soft lighting, and a chill environment that lets you unwind and escape.<br><br> Story-Paced Tutorial and Guided Orders<br><br> Learn the barista craft through a gentle introduction and hands-on practice \u2014 no prior experience needed. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939300/extras/49cbf0c2cd7f9b354c36667ec0be3398.poster.avif?t=1767485846\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939300/extras/49cbf0c2cd7f9b354c36667ec0be3398.webm?t=1767485846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939300/extras/49cbf0c2cd7f9b354c36667ec0be3398.mp4?t=1767485846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Unusual features<br><br> You can refill your stocks with your phone, dive into different adventures by playing mini games, take pictures of the coffee you made with the camera feature, share posts and increase your popularity with in-game social media, or examine what your customers think about your cafe.<br>You can explore and interact with various places. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939300/extras/dff1959433f25b7ece5839ef6befbdbc.poster.avif?t=1767485846\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939300/extras/dff1959433f25b7ece5839ef6befbdbc.webm?t=1767485846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939300/extras/dff1959433f25b7ece5839ef6befbdbc.mp4?t=1767485846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Waiter system  <br><br>When customers sit at their table, they perform tasks such as taking their orders, taking them away, and collecting dirty glasses.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939300/extras/999b69488c06dce4db8ef56196cf4780.poster.avif?t=1767485846\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939300/extras/999b69488c06dce4db8ef56196cf4780.webm?t=1767485846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939300/extras/999b69488c06dce4db8ef56196cf4780.mp4?t=1767485846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Manage your cafe<br><br> Coffee prices, cafe open and closed status, statistics, customization, and many more features<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939300/extras/42b032771edde02637ff815988b02f23.poster.avif?t=1767485846\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939300/extras/42b032771edde02637ff815988b02f23.webm?t=1767485846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939300/extras/42b032771edde02637ff815988b02f23.mp4?t=1767485846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Order Accuracy Matters<br><br> Match orders carefully to customer expectations. Are you a perfectionist? You'll love getting it just right. <br><br>Who Is This Game For?  <br><br>Whether you\u2019re a coffee lover, a cozy game enjoyer, or just someone looking for a chill way to spend time \u2014 Barista Dream is your perfect blend of comfort and challenge.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939300?t=1767485846","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939300/238e8e23f49a811237381aa853424d6c58126210/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767485846","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939300/7d410e60e9df32a20508d4540d97642959640de3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767485846","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939300/7d410e60e9df32a20508d4540d97642959640de3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767485846","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3963140,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Barista Dream \u2014 a cozy first-person barista simulator where you brew handcrafted coffee for unique customers in a warm and relaxing caf\u00e9.  <br><br>Step behind the counter and start your journey as a passionate barista! <br><br>Take orders, prepare drinks with precision, and explore the stories of your regulars. In this first-person simulator, it\u2019s all about atmosphere, attention to detail, and the joy of making the perfect cup of coffee. <br><br> Realistic Coffee Making <br><br> Grind beans, press espresso, steam milk, ca